OL,4,BVerstappen's superb racecraft &        
OL,5,BRussell's costly mistake - driver      
OL,6,Bratings                                
OL,7,GMax Verstappen sealed his fourth win   
OL,8,Gof the season with a stunning victory  
OL,9,Gat a chaotic Las Vegas Grand Prix.     
OL,11,FThe Red Bull driver fought off his     
OL,12,Frivals for the lead throughout the     
OL,13,Frace and crossed the line ahead of the 
OL,14,Ftwo McLarens of Lando Norris and Oscar 
OL,15,FPiastri.                               
